From ea1c221e3987913df34e51142f4735c8d1dda001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 11:45:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] chore(tokens): ship the SIL OFL 1.1 notice with the
 webfont-demo fixture
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Poppins subset embedded in brands/webfont-demo/brand.json carries only
its copyright string in the WOFF name table (nameIDs 0-6; no license
entries), so nothing in the repo held the license text. OFL 1.1 §2
requires the license to accompany copies; add it next to the fixture.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CVjvRP7P9oSiX3uhjK1xsz
---
 tokens/brands/webfont-demo/OFL.txt | 55 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 55 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tokens/brands/webfont-demo/OFL.txt

diff --git a/tokens/brands/webfont-demo/OFL.txt b/tokens/brands/webfont-demo/OFL.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f7445f9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tokens/brands/webfont-demo/OFL.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,55 @@
