+
+This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
+This license is copied below, and is also available with a FAQ at:
+https://openfontlicense.org
+
+The embedded font in brand.json (fontFaces[0].src) is a basic-Latin
+(U+0020-U+007E) subset of Poppins Regular, repackaged as WOFF. It is a
+Modified Version under the terms below.
+
